<Layout title="Questions to Ask When Interviewing a Probate Attorney in Texas" description="If you're navigating an estate in Texas, finding the right probate attorney matters. Here are the questions worth asking before you hire anyone.">

  <section class="page-hero navy-bg">
    <div class="container">
